OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal underway after judge bans
OL,4,ADrumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn appeal is underway against a High
OL,7,FCourt ruling banning Portadown
OL,8,FOrangemen from marching along the
OL,9,FGarvaghy Road on Sunday.
OL,11,FOn Friday the Parades Commission
OL,12,Fannounced that the Orange Order parade
OL,13,Fcould proceed for the first time in
OL,14,Falmost 30 years with restrictions in
OL,15,Fplace.
OL,17,FThe Garvaghy Road Residents' Coalition
OL,18,F(GRRC) had mounted a legal challenge to
OL,19,Fthe decision and on Saturday afternoon
OL,20,Fa High Court judge issued an injunction
OL,21,Fhalting the march.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
