OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal underway after judge bans
OL,4,ADrumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision is being appealed, with an
OL,7,Femergency court sitting underway. It
OL,8,Fcame after Portadown District Orange
OL,9,FLodge declined a request from Judge
OL,10,FPatricia Smyth to postpone the parade
OL,11,Funtil all issues were properly
OL,12,Fconsidered.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
